All your breaks on one screen.

Tap the star on a spot and it lands in your favorites. Pipeline, Uluwatu, J-Bay, Supertubos, Chicama, Mundaka. Twelve spots, each with its size and rating.

They're grouped by country, with the next days laid out as bars. Swipe through once and you know where it's Epic and where it's just Good.

3,056 spots, 16 days out, four updates a day. Free.
